## About This Project (Improved-TopiCLEAR)
In this enhanced version of TopiCLEAR, we replace the conventional single last-layer sentence embedding with a multi-layer intermediate hidden states aggregation approach. By extracting and combining representations from multiple transformer encoder layers, our method captures richer lexical, syntactic, and semantic features, ultimately leading to more robust and discriminative topic clustering.

